# Database

Schema is created in `database/sqlite.py` (`init_db`). There are no Django migrations.

- Parameterize every query; never format user text into SQL
- Filter by `user_id` / owner on reads and writes (no tenant leaks)
- Use the existing connection helper (`get_db` / `get_connection`); do not open ad-hoc engines
- Multi-statement writes in one transaction; commit/rollback as `get_db` already does
- BM25/FTS and memory tables stay in SQLite; vectors stay in Chroma
